'''Heaven's Back Alley''' (天界バル横丁, ''Tenkai Baru Yokochō'', '''Heavenly Bar Alley''') is the 16th sub-chapter of [[Legend Stages|Uncanny Legends]], and the 65th sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 8.8 Update|Version 8.8]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter is a remake of [[Parthenon]]. Fairly simple except for [[Bathtub of Whimsy]], which is a big bottleneck because of its [[Hackey]]s coupled with [[Brollow]] spam.
{{LegendDiff|140|180|100}}

